{
  "name": "645. Video /content names one video of a task with index; a malformed index or one the task does not have is a 400 naming index (video content index)",
  "description": "Local fixture regression for TXE-7040 (Bifrost–Tokun contract C9), no live provider calls. Start tests/e2e/api/runners/provider-error-fixture.mjs and an isolated gateway on tests/e2e/api/provider_config/provider-error-fixture.config.json and run with providerErrorFixture=1; every case is skipped otherwise. fixture_video_keys is an OpenAI-based custom provider on the fixture, and OpenAI stores one file per video id. GET /v1/videos/{id}/content and the OpenAI SDK route GET /openai/v1/videos/{id}/content take index, a non-negative integer naming one of the task's videos (default 0). 645.2 and 645.3 send a malformed index on each route: a 400 with error.param index, before any vendor call. 645.4 asks for index 1 of a single-file video: a 400 naming index instead of the one file served as if it were the second. 645.5 reads the fixture's counters: only 645.4 reached the vendor, once, with the key it named. Red before the change: index was ignored, so every row answered 200 with the first (only) file. The Go tests cover the multi-video case itself on Vertex gs:// (Cloud Storage, two Veo samples), the Gemini API (two generated samples) and the Omni interaction paths, which no fixture route stands in for; a source check in core/providers/utils fails a provider that picks a task's Videos at a fixed position.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "645.1 fixture hit counters reset before the video content index rows (video content index)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('counters cleared', function () { pm.expect(j.data[0].reset, pm.response.text()).to.equal(true); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{providerErrorFixtureUrl}}/__reset",
          "host": [
            "{{providerErrorFixtureUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "__reset"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "645.2 /v1/videos/{id}/content on fixture_video_keys with index=abc is a 400 naming index [EXPECT-400] (video content index)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('400 naming index, as a caller_invalid_request', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, pm.response.text()).to.equal(400);",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(j.error && j.error.param, pm.response.text()).to.equal('index');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-bf-api-key",
            "value": "fixture-video-key-a"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/videos/video_gapped_1:fixture_video_keys/content?index=abc",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "videos",
            "video_gapped_1:fixture_video_keys",
            "content"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "index",
              "value": "abc"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
